    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "MUST";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Ensure efficiency and adequacy";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The President is responsible for ensuring that the FWC performs its functions.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The President MUST ensure efficiency and adequacy.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/prepared-by-the-office-of-parliamentary-counsel-canberra-fair-work-act-2009-sec-581> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/prepared-by-the-office-of-parliamentary-counsel-canberra-fair-work-act-2009-sec-581-logic-deontic-2>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/prepared-by-the-office-of-parliamentary-counsel-canberra-fair-work-act-2009-sec-581-logic-deontic-2> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "MUST";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Ensure adequate service to employers, employees, and persons covered by Chapters 3A and 3B";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The President is responsible for ensuring that the FWC performs its functions and exercises its powers in a manner that: (a) is efficient; and (b) adequately serves the needs of employers and employees throughout Australia; and (c) adequately serves the needs of persons covered by Chapter 3A; and (d) adequately serves the needs of persons covered by Chapter 3B.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The President MUST ensure adequate service to employers, employees, and persons covered by Chapters 3A and 3B.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/prepared-by-the-office-of-parliamentary-counsel-canberra-fair-work-act-2009-sec-581> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/prepared-by-the-office-of-parliamentary-counsel-canberra-fair-work-act-2009-sec-581-logic-deontic-3>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/prepared-by-the-office-of-parliamentary-counsel-canberra-fair-work-act-2009-sec-581-logic-deontic-3> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "MUST";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Facilitate cooperation with prescribed State industrial authorities";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The President must perform his or her own functions and exercise his or her own powers in a manner that facilitates cooperation with prescribed State industrial authorities.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The President MUST facilitate cooperation with prescribed State industrial authorities.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
