    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) an FWC Member is dealing with a matter (other than by forming part of a Full Bench or an Expert Panel in relation to a matter); and (b) the FWC Member becomes unavailable to continue dealing with the matter before the matter is completely dealt with.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The FWC Member must complete the matter before becoming unavailable";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
