    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Requires specific conditions for transfer of business.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) the employment of a person who is a State public sector employee of the old State employer has terminated;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "there is a transfer of business from a non-national system employer to a national system employer";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/prepared-by-the-office-of-parliamentary-counsel-canberra-fair-work-act-2009-sec-768ad-ss-1> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/prepared-by-the-office-of-parliamentary-counsel-canberra-fair-work-act-2009-sec-768ad-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-2>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/prepared-by-the-office-of-parliamentary-counsel-canberra-fair-work-act-2009-sec-768ad-ss-1-logic-alleninterval-2> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/AllenInterval>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "during";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Occurs during employment termination and new employment.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) the employment of a person who is a State public sector employee of the old State employer has terminated;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "the transfer of business occurs within 3 months after the termination";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::interval_reasoning";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/prepared-by-the-office-of-parliamentary-counsel-canberra-fair-work-act-2009-sec-768ad-ss-1> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/prepared-by-the-office-of-parliamentary-counsel-canberra-fair-work-act-2009-sec-768ad-ss-1-logic-ltl-3>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/prepared-by-the-office-of-parliamentary-counsel-canberra-fair-work-act-2009-sec-768ad-ss-1-logic-ltl-3> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LogicApplication>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/LTL>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "everywhere";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Occurs everywhere in the employment relationship.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(b) within 3 months after the termination, the person becomes employed by the new employer;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "the transfer of business occurs throughout the employment relationship";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::temporal_ltl";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/prepared-by-the-office-of-parliamentary-counsel-canberra-fair-work-act-2009-sec-768ad-ss-1> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/prepared-by-the-office-of-parliamentary-counsel-canberra-fair-work-act-2009-sec-768ad-ss-1-logic-deontic-4>.
