    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) that the conduct was engaged in by an official of the government; and (b) that the official had that state of mind.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The Australian government is obligated to establish the state of mind of its officials in relation to particular conduct.";
